"I wonder if I can pray for healing right now, or to cure food poisoning?"

This effectively removes the "failed prayer because you tried before
your timeout was done" from the game.  In case you haven't noticed
before, praying while it won't be granted leaves you "helpless"; there
are a not-insignificant number of deaths on NAO and SHC where people
weren't sure of their prayer timeout, tried, and exploded.

Removing this is not a good thing.  Prayer should not be guaranteed-known
without _some_ effort on the player's part.

Again, this is just the suggestion of someone who isn't very good at the
game trying to redefine the game so that he can win, rather than
learning to win at the existing game.

